리 사격이 잘 듣는다.","role":"main","kind":"sky"},{"monster_id":"r71_comet_5","region_id":"comet_crater","monster_name":"혜성 심의 파수꾼","monster_type":"지역 우두머리","min_level":13,"max_level":15,"hp":378,"attack_power":31,"spawn_weight":12,"description":"혜성 심에 깃든 하늘의 것. 천명원이 쳐 둔 봉인을 하나씩 깨뜨린다.","drops":{"thunder_ore":3,"star_sand":2,"monster_core":1},"difficulty_rank":10,"mechanic_key":"seal_breaker","mechanic_description":"봉인을 약하게 만든다. 부적과 봉인 재료를 챙겨라.","role":"guardian","kind":"breaker"},{"monster_id":"r71_cloud_1","region_id":"cloud_corridor","monster_name":"구름 해파리","monster_type":"천상 요괴","min_level":16,"max_level":19,"hp":294,"attack_power":26,"spawn_weight":14,"description":"구름 속을 떠다니는 투명한 해파리. 닿으면 몸이 붕 뜬다.","drops":{"cloud_cotton":1},"difficulty_rank":2,"mechanic_key":"aerial","mechanic_description":"하늘에서 내리꽂는다. 원거리 사격이 잘 듣는다.","role":"common","kind":"sky"},{"monster_id":"r71_cloud_2","region_id":"cloud_corridor","monster_name":"난간 바람귀","monster_type":"원령","min_level":16,"max_level":19,"hp":294,"attack_power":26,"spawn_weight":14,"description":"회랑에서 떨어져 죽은 천문관의 넋. 바람이 되어 난간을 흔든다.","drops":{"ghost_ash":1},"difficulty_rank":2,"mechanic_key":"spectral","mechanic_description":"몸이 반쯤 비친다. 물리 공격이 덜 듣고 술법이 잘 듣는다.","role":"common","kind":"ghost"},{"monster_id":"r71_cloud_3","region_id":"cloud_corridor","monster_name":"날개 펼친 회랑 석상","monster_type":"갑각 요괴","min_level":18,"max_level":22,"hp":2400,"attack_power":120,"spawn_weight":15,"description":"회랑을 지키던 돌 석상. 날개를 펴고 덮친다.","drops":{"ore":3,"ward_fragment":2,"jade_shard":1},"difficulty_rank":5,"mechanic_key":"armored","mechanic_description":"껍질이 단단하다. 방어를 무시하는 공격이나 술법이 낫다.","role":"main","kind":"shell"},{"monster_id":"r71_cloud_4","region_id":"cloud_corridor","monster_name":"번개 머금은 학","monster_type":"비행 요괴","min_level":18,"max_level":22,"hp":2400,"attack_power":120,"spawn_weight":15,"description":"번개를 맞고도 살아난 학. 날갯짓마다 번개가 튄다.","drops":{"sky_feather":2,"thunder_ore":1},"difficulty_rank":5,"mechanic_key":"aerial","mechanic_description":"하늘에서 내리꽂는다. 원거리 사격이 잘 듣는다.","role":"main","kind":"bird"},{"monster_id":"r71_cloud_5","region_id":"cloud_corridor","monster_name":"회랑 끝의 천문 거울","monster_type":"지역 우두머리","min_level":16,"max_level":18,"hp":441,"attack_power":36,"spawn_weight":12,"description":"회랑 끝 망대에 걸린 커다란 거울. 별을 비추던 것이 이제 공격을 되비춘다.","drops":{"mirror_shard":3,"star_sand":2,"steel_ingot":1},"difficulty_rank":10,"mechanic_key":"reflect","mechanic_description":"공격의 일부를 되돌린다. 원거리 사격이나 봉인 제압을 써라.","role":"guardian","kind":"mirror"}]$J$::jsonb) as x(monster_id text, region_id text, monster_name text, monster_type text, min_level int, max_level int, hp int, attack_power int, spawn_weight int, description text, drops jsonb, difficulty_rank int, mechanic_key text, mechanic_description text, role text, kind text)
on conflict (monster_id) do update set monster_name = excluded.monster_name, description = excluded.description, drops = excluded.drops, min_level = excluded.min_level, max_level = excluded.max_level, hp = excluded.hp, attack_power = excluded.attack_power, mechanic_key = excluded.mechanic_key, kind = excluded.kind, role = excluded.role;
